Description: pretty fancy and modern terminal file manager
 superfile is a modern, feature-rich TUI file manager for the terminal. It
 presents a multi-panel layout with a pinned-directory sidebar, a file preview
 pane and a processes bar that tracks long-running copy, move and delete
 operations.
 .
 It supports fuzzy search, batch renaming, archive extraction and compression,
 image previews, Git status indicators, a built-in trash bin with restore, and
 zoxide-backed directory jumping. Themes, hotkeys and the panel layout are all
 configurable.
 .
 The command shipped by this package is "spf".
